'''Bargain Battlefield''' (特売バトルロード, ''Tokubai Batoru Rōdo '', '''Special Sale Battle Road''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Bargain Battlefield will reset when the event ends.

==Overview==
===About===
Bargain Battlefield contains a total of 10 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Legendary Baskets.

